  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Enhanced Performance and Value for Money (EPVM) Projects- Technical Support to HST Affordable Medicine for Malaria (AMfM) Pilot is a component of Malaria: Improving the Global Response reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;31,737. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Malaria control, Health education.</narrative>
  </description>
